Package: fastgit
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Bare-metal C git reimplementation - hash-agile SHA256, 38 verbs, pack batch
 Fast, portable `git` in C23 with OpenSSL acceleration, libcurl/libssh
 transports. Interoperates with `git cat-file` via objectFormat=sha256.
